# K:Rebound expands (CardFactoryUtil.java:2422-2451) to a Moved replacement
# for the spell going Stack -> Graveyard on resolution (Fizzle$ False, cast
# from its owner's hand): Staggershock is exiled instead, ready for the
# next-upkeep cast. The 2 damage kills the Bears first.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 R
tapformana human 3 R
tapformana human 4 R
queue paygeneric R
queue paygeneric R
queue targets 5
castspell human 1
resolvestack
# The delayed trigger (Phase$ Upkeep, ValidPlayer$ You) fires at human's next
# upkeep, turn 3, after ai's turn 2 (ai draws its Swamp): human casts
# Staggershock from exile for free, at the AI's face.
run 2
advance
advance
queue optionaltrigger true
queue confirmeffect true
queue targets ai
resolvestack
resolvestack
